      },
      "hints": [
        "Use $P(5,7)$ and $Q(-2,0)$ in the distance formula.",
        "Average the two $x$-coordinates and the two $y$-coordinates."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "$PQ=\\sqrt{7^2+7^2}=\\sqrt{98}=7\\sqrt2$.",
        "$N=((5+(-2))/2,(7+0)/2)=(3/2,7/2)$."
